The Partner undertakes to:
— clearly disclose the commercial nature of their posts, as required by law; in France, the wording “publicité” or “collaboration commerciale” must remain visible throughout the promotion;
— present the Service only through its actual features, with no promise of results and no misleading statement about prices or discounts;
— not bid on the “Wedillybird” brand or on similar terms in search engine advertising;
— not distribute their link or code through unsolicited messages, nor on coupon aggregator sites without our written agreement;
— use the Wedillybird name and visuals only as we supply them.
The Partner does not speak on behalf of Wedillybird and enters into no commitment in our name.
